{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12355","headline":"晚归蓝田旧居 · 钱起","name":"晚归蓝田旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云卷东臯下，归来省故蹊。\n泉移怜石在，林长觉原低。\n旧里情难尽，前山赏未迷。\n引藤看古木，尝酒咒春鸡。\n兴与时髦背，年将野老齐。\n才微甘引退，应得遂霞栖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}